    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The candles are all guttering out in the drawing room... and the fog is coming right up to the windows again. It feels like the house itself is just waiting to dissolve into the mist. I don't think I have the strength to keep the lights burning anymore. Everything feels so heavy, Julian. Like there's no point in even lifting a hand to fix anything. It's just... nothingness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
